# Intermediate state of the sweep, regenerated by every run of run_all.sh and
# deliberately NOT committed:
#
#   ledger_ec63.json   S1 writes the population, S2 the observed opens and every
#                      probe's B output, S3 the A/B rows.  Tens of megabytes of
#                      other tickets' probe output; the transcripts here carry
#                      the parts that are evidence.
#   .ec63_shim/        the `sitecustomize.py` carrying the `open` audit hook
#   .ec63_trace_*.txt    one probe's observed opens, truncated before each probe
ledger_ec63.json
.ec63_shim/
.ec63_trace_*.txt
__pycache__/
